==Description==
'''Elementalist Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in the [[Operation I.C.E Event]] as a reward for reaching Level 14 on the premium track. It had a cost of {{Bell|410}} or {{Robux|58}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{Bell|2,460}} or {{Robux|930}}.

==Appearance==
'''Elementalist Charm''' appearance is based on the default [[Elementalist]], one of the event towers from the [[Operation I.C.E Event]]. The charm has it placed on a rock with one of its arms on the ground. When placed down, it plays a sound of a crystallic object behind dropped down.

The charm has a light blue color with a crystallized texture. It does not change colors.

